EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Whaat?!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}I dreamed last night that
someone who looked just like you
would visit{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}And now my dream's come true!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Whoa. That is really freaky.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

